{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12900","headline":"扈从郊庙因呈两省诸公 · 韩翃","name":"扈从郊庙因呈两省诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹墀列士主恩同，厩马翩翩出汉宫。\n奉引乘舆金仗里，亲尝赐食玉盘中。\n昼趋行殿旌门北，夜宿斋房刻漏东。\n明日驾回承雨露，齐将万岁及春风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12900.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12900","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}